DTSTAMP:20260520T001306
CREATED:20250309T145031Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260310T140019Z
UID:10027828-1779246000-1779332399@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Ask About Our Featured Listings
DESCRIPTION:Established in February 2019\, LiveMusicAsheville.com now reaches thousands of people every week actively searching for live music in the Asheville area. Roughly 60% of our traffic comes from Google Search as we dominate the top of the results for queries such as “Asheville live music” & “live music Asheville”. Meanwhile our direct traffic is experiencing explosive growth\, proving more locals are now using us as their go-to music calendar. \nOur free listings include just the basics of Who’s Playin’ Where & When. We offer Descriptive Listings at just $5 per event to help you guide viewers to your event. These listings include up to 30 words but do not include links.  \nOur Featured Listings really stand out among the dozens of events on the calendar every day. While we update every Wednesday for the following Friday thru Thursday\, these Featured Listings are published much sooner and include your picture or poster\, a description of the event and the venue\, website/ticket links and a Google map. We also share these events on our social media stories to help further promote your show. \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/ask-about-our-featured-listings/2026-05-20/
LOCATION:LiveMusicAsheville.com\, ASHEVILLE\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Fairview,Live Music,Madison County,Mills River,South Asheville/Arden/Fletcher,Weaverville
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/IMG_4145-e1770855289327.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="LiveMusicAsheville.com":MAILTO:livemusicasheville@gmail.com
GEO:35.5671423;-82.5437614
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260520
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260522
DTSTAMP:20260520T001306
CREATED:20260414T192952Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260414T192952Z
UID:10056680-1779246000-1779332399@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:COMING Friday May 22nd | Supernova - A Tribute to Oasis w/sg Alla Prima
DESCRIPTION:Fri\, May 22nd\, 2026 || Doors 6PM || Show 7PM || From $17 Event Details and Tickets \nSupernova is an Oasis tribute band obsessed with recreating the raw energy\, intensity\, and swagger of a real Oasis gig. Most fans never got the chance to see Oasis in their prime – when they were still the scrappy Manchester lads playing clubs and theaters with something to prove. Supernova exists to deliver that experience: an intimate\, high-energy show where you can feel the music in your chest and sing every word at the top of your lungs. \nSupernova isn’t just another tribute band going through the motions. This six-piece outfit is obsessed with recreating the energy\, intensity\, and swagger of a live Oasis performance. From the opening chords of “Rock ‘n’ Roll Star” to the final notes of “Champagne Supernova\,” every show is crafted to deliver the full Oasis experience—loud\, raw\, and unapologetic rock and roll. thesupernovatribute.com \nAsheville’s local garage rock/alt-blues band Alla Prima opens the show!! allaprimaofficial.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-friday-may-22nd-supernova-a-tribute-to-oasis-w-sg-alla-prima/2026-05-20/
LOCATION:Eulogy\, 10 Buxton Ave\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/THU-JULY-23-•-CROZEN-VA-•-PRO-RE-NATA-4-e1776193899603.png
GEO:35.5883468;-82.5539256
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Eulogy 10 Buxton Ave Asheville NC 28801;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=10 Buxton Ave:geo:-82.5539256,35.5883468
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260520
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260522
DTSTAMP:20260520T001306
CREATED:20260512T204313Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260512T204313Z
UID:10062659-1779246000-1779332399@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:COMING Saturday May 23rd | Darren Nicholson Band Bluegrass & Square Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, May 23  •  8 PM – 11 PM | $20 Pre-Sale/$25 DOS  Event Details and Tickets\n\nBring your dancing shoes and be a part of the fun. An evening of hot bluegrass and traditional mountain dance with Darren Nicholson Band!\n\n\n\nDarren Nicholson Band shares some of their chart topping bluegrass songs with audience participation dances sprinkled in. World renowned caller and dancer Heidi Kulas will lead you through mountain square dances as well as contradances. EVERYONE is welcome!! \n\n\n  \nIf you’re looking to be impressed\, you will be – if you’re looking to make a friend\, you already have. Darren Nicholson\, who has played mountain music since his youth in Western North Carolina\, is a high-caliber musician with substantial contributions to such acts as Alecia Nugent and Balsam Range. \nYes\, he’s a punchy mandolinist with instrumentation nods to Bill Monroe and Marty Stuart\, but he’s also an introspective songwriter\, technical harmony singer\, convincing lead vocalist\, and a man on a mission. Since going solo\, Nicholson has persistently and earnestly invested in his shows\, making each one a tailored experience. They are genuine\, entertaining\, and an extended handshake to the community. He’s accomplished this all while managing to retain the fun-witted and approachable character formed in his raising. \nDarren Nicholson. Homegrown. Whole Hearted. Music with a purpose. darrennicholson.net/about \nWith two unique locations\, built inside buildings that were previously cast aside\, One World brews with the intention of fostering nourishing interaction and artistic cultural experiences. From live music to art shows\, “One World Brewing” is born from the magic that happens when the whole becomes greater than the sum of its parts. Our taprooms are intersections for people of all walks of life and different corners of the globe\, enjoying this time and place together.  Check out our upcoming schedule: click here
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-saturday-may-23rd-darren-nicholson-band-bluegrass-square-dance-party/2026-05-20/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/682156732_1556296279838582_8967624870550926936_n-e1778618353896.jpg
GEO:35.5783642;-82.5848526
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=One World Brewing – West 520 Haywood Rd Asheville North Carolina 28806;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=520 Haywood Rd:geo:-82.5848526,35.5783642
END:VEVENT
